# Price action without volume

Ten sessions as classic tick bars: the open juts left, the close juts right,
and the vertical spans the session's range. `gaps: collapse` puts the two
weekends nowhere, because a market that was shut did not trade flat.

```mdv ohlc
title: ACME — daily
x: date
style: bar
gaps: collapse
precision: 2
format: table
---
date       |  open |  high |   low | close
2026-08-03 | 41.20 | 42.05 | 40.90 | 41.85
2026-08-04 | 41.90 | 42.40 | 41.10 | 41.30
2026-08-05 | 41.35 | 41.60 | 39.80 | 40.05
2026-08-06 | 40.10 | 41.75 | 40.00 | 41.60
2026-08-07 | 41.65 | 42.20 | 41.40 | 42.10
2026-08-10 | 42.05 | 43.15 | 41.95 | 43.00
2026-08-11 | 43.10 | 43.40 | 42.30 | 42.55
2026-08-12 | 42.50 | 42.85 | 41.70 | 41.90
2026-08-13 | 41.95 | 42.60 | 41.85 | 42.45
2026-08-14 | 42.50 | 43.80 | 42.40 | 43.65
```
